[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0010","text":"呜哇……\n『跨越高楼峡谷间架设的木板VR体验』……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0020","text":"好、好可怕～！\n风一直在吹，脚下的木板还嘎吱嘎吱晃～～！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0030","text":"加油—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0040","text":"再怎么能撑也有个限度啊～～！\n往下一看就忍不住哇地叫出来，根本不敢看～！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0050","text":"慢慢……慢慢……恋钟酱……\n…………啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0055","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0060","text":"呜哇～～～！？\n掉、掉下去了～～～！！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0070","text":"哎呀呀……\n头朝下直直坠落"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0080","text":"啊……恋钟酱……\n好像可以再试一次哦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0090","text":"下次……再努力一下吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0100","text":"我感觉自己肯定还会掉下去～！\n摩美美、雾子～！换你们来～～～！！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30400200_01_0105","text":"Motion"}]
